---
<SiteLayout title="NightGuildBot — Your community, your guild" description="Guilds, shared progression, fishing, music and chat games."><section class="container hero"><span class="eyebrow">A COMMUNITY BOT WITH A WORLD OF ITS OWN</span><h1>Make your server<br/><span class="gradient">a place to belong.</span></h1><p class="lead">Build a guild, chase progression, fill your Fishdex and make every conversation a little more fun. NightGuildBot brings community features and game-like systems together.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="docs/getting-started.html">Get started →</a><a class="button" href="docs/index.html">Explore documentation</a></div><p class="muted">Independently developed · Guilds · Fishing · RPG · Music</p></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE NIGHTGUILD EXPERIENCE</span><h2>More than a bot.<br/><span class="gradient">A shared adventure.</span></h2></div><p class="muted">Bring the tools your community needs together with systems that give members something to discover, collect and build.</p></div><div class="feature-grid">{features.map(([icon,title,desc,href])=><a class="feature-card" href={href}><div class="feature-icon">{icon}</div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{desc}</p></a>)}</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container callout-banner"><div><span class="eyebrow">READY WHEN YOU ARE</span><h2>Find your place in the guild.</h2><p class="muted">Start with the overview, then explore the features that interest you.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="docs/index.html">Explore NightGuildBot →</a></div></section></SiteLayout>